/*!
\page page_sttofcell StTofCell

\brief Matched cell in the legacy STAR Time-of-Flight (TOF) detector.

\section tofcell_overview Overview

StTofCell represents a matched cell in the legacy STAR TOF detector —
the MRPC-based barrel TOF system active from approximately Run 3 through Run 7.
A cell is the smallest readout unit of the MRPC and is associated with a single reconstructed track.

It stores raw electronic data (ADC, TDC, leading/trailing edge times) and spatial information
(3D hit position, z-hit), together with the track-match quality flag.

\note This class belongs to the legacy TOF system, superseded by \ref StBTofHit for Run 8+.

Cells are stored in \ref StTofCollection via StEvent::tofCollection().

\section tofcell_hierarchy Class Hierarchy

\code{.txt}
TObject → StObject → StTofCell
\endcode

\section tofcell_members Data Members

| Member | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| mTrayIndex | Int_t | Tray index |
| mModuleIndex | Int_t | Module index within tray |
| mCellIndex | Int_t | Cell index within module |
| mDaqIndex | Int_t | DAQ channel index |
| mAdc | Int_t | Raw ADC value |
| mTdc | Int_t | Raw TDC value |
| mLeadingEdgeTime | Double_t | Calibrated leading-edge time [ns] |
| mTrailingEdgeTime | Double_t | Calibrated trailing-edge time [ns] |
| mAssociatedTrack | StLink<StTrack> | Matched reconstructed track |
| mZhit | Float_t | z-position of hit [cm] |
| mMatchFlag | Int_t | Track-to-cell matching quality flag |
| mPosition | StThreeVectorD | Full 3D hit position [cm] |

tot() returns trailing − leading edge time [ns] (time-over-threshold).

\section tofcell_methods Key Methods

- trayIndex(), moduleIndex(), cellIndex() — geometry indices
- adc() — raw ADC value
- tdc() — raw TDC value
- leadingEdgeTime() — calibrated leading-edge time [ns]
- trailingEdgeTime() — calibrated trailing-edge time [ns]
- tot() — time-over-threshold [ns]
- associatedTrack() — pointer to matched StTrack
- zHit() — z-coordinate of hit [cm]
- matchFlag() — match quality flag
- position() — 3D hit position [cm]

\section tofcell_example Usage Example

\code{.cpp}
StTofCollection* coll = event->tofCollection();
if (coll) {
    const StSPtrVecTofCell& cells = coll->tofCells();
    for (const auto& c : cells) {
        double leTime = c->leadingEdgeTime();
        double teTime = c->trailingEdgeTime();
        float  tot    = c->tot();
        float  zHit   = c->zHit();
    }
}
\endcode

\see StTofHit, StTofData, StTofCollection
*/
